<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115425" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψελλός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>faltering in speech,</i>
			like a child; distd. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραυλός</span> (lisping), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				492b32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				902b22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ψ.</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.206S.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ψελλὴ "οὐ πιττεύω"</span>
			(i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιστεύω</span>)
				<i><span class="en">Suid.,
					<u>App.Prov.</u>3.17</span></i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			 of words, <i>inarticulate, obscure, unintelligible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				816
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψελλόν ἐστι καὶ καλεῖ τὴν ἄρκτον
					ἄρτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					393
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
